namespace AnalyticNumberTheory.Mertens
open Filter Topology Real Asymptotics
noncomputable abbrev mertensSecondConstant:ℝ:=
 GoldbachRoughFifth.AnalyticInput.ErdosStraus.PrimeEstimates.Mertens.mertensSecondConstant
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000 in
mutual
theorem aiu:
  ∃C>0,∀ᶠ x:ℝ in atTop,
   |primeReciprocalSum ⌊x⌋₊-(log (log x)+mertensSecondConstant)| ≤
    C/log x:=by
 obtain ⟨C,hC,hbound⟩:=
  GoldbachRoughFifth.AnalyticInput.ErdosStraus.PrimeEstimates.Mertens.mertensSecond
 refine ⟨C,hC,?_⟩
 filter_upwards [eventually_ge_atTop (2:ℝ)] with x hx
 exact hbound x hx
theorem aLY:
  (fun n:ℕ=>primeReciprocalSum n-
   (log (log (n:ℝ))+mertensSecondConstant)) =O[atTop]
   fun n=>1/log (n:ℝ):=by
 obtain ⟨D,_,hD⟩:=aiu
 have hreal:
   (fun x:ℝ=>primeReciprocalSum ⌊x⌋₊-
    (log (log x)+mertensSecondConstant)) =O[atTop]
    fun x:ℝ=>1/log x:=by
  apply Asymptotics.IsBigO.of_bound D
  filter_upwards [hD,eventually_gt_atTop (1:ℝ)] with x hx hx1
  have hlog:0<log x:=Real.log_pos hx1
  simpa [Real.norm_eq_abs,abs_of_pos (one_div_pos.mpr hlog),
   div_eq_mul_inv,abs_of_pos hlog] using hx
 simpa [Nat.floor_natCast] using hreal.natCast_atTop
end
