def jU (k s j:ℕ):ℕ:=
 ((2^k).choose j*2^(s*j))/2^(k+s)
theorem Xg {j:ℕ} (hj:0<j):j.factorization 2<j:=by
 have hv:j.factorization 2≤ multiplicity 2 j:=
  Nat.factorization_le_multiplicity (n:=j) (p:=2)
 have hl:multiplicity 2 j≤Nat.log 2 j:=
  multiplicity_le_nat_log (p:=2) j
 exact lt_of_le_of_lt (le_trans hv hl) (Nat.log_lt_self 2 hj.ne')
theorem agg (k s j:ℕ) (hj:0<j)
  (hjk:j≤2^k):
  ((2^k).choose j*2^(s*j)).factorization 2=
   ((2^k).choose j).factorization 2+s*j:=by
 rw [Nat.factorization_mul (Nat.choose_pos hjk).ne' (by positivity)]
 simp only [Finsupp.add_apply,Nat.prime_two.factorization_pow,
  Finsupp.single_eq_same]
theorem ax7 (k s j:ℕ) (hs:1≤ s)
  (hj:0<j) (hjk:j≤2^k):
  2^(k+s)∣(2^k).choose j*2^(s*j):=by
 have hc:=Nat.factorization_choose_prime_pow_add_factorization Nat.prime_two hjk hj.ne'
 have hv:=Xg hj
 have hscale:s+j.factorization 2≤ s*j:=by
  nlinarith
 apply (Nat.prime_two.pow_dvd_iff_le_factorization
  (Nat.mul_ne_zero (Nat.choose_pos hjk).ne' (by positivity))).mpr
 rw [agg k s j hj hjk]
 omega
theorem TD (k s j:ℕ) (hs:1≤ s)
  (hj:0<j) (hjk:j≤2^k):
  2^(k+s)*jU k s j=(2^k).choose j*2^(s*j):=
 Nat.mul_div_cancel' (ax7 k s j hs hj hjk)
theorem TE (k s j:ℕ) (hs:1≤ s)
  (hj:0<j) (hjk:j≤2^k):0<jU k s j:=by
 have he:=TD k s j hs hj hjk
 have hp:0<(2^k).choose j*2^(s*j):=
  Nat.mul_pos (Nat.choose_pos hjk) (by positivity)
 rw [← he] at hp
 exact Nat.pos_of_mul_pos_left hp
theorem RZ (k s j:ℕ) (hs:1≤ s)
  (hj:0<j) (hjk:j≤2^k):
  (jU k s j).factorization 2+j.factorization 2+s=s*j:=by
 have hc:=Nat.factorization_choose_prime_pow_add_factorization Nat.prime_two hjk hj.ne'
 have he:=congrArg (fun n:ℕ=>n.factorization 2)
  (TD k s j hs hj hjk)
 rw [Nat.factorization_mul (by positivity)
  (TE k s j hs hj hjk).ne',
  agg k s j hj hjk] at he
 simp only [Finsupp.add_apply,Nat.prime_two.factorization_pow,
  Finsupp.single_eq_same] at he
 omega
theorem auC (k s K j:ℕ) (hs:2≤ s)
  (hbudget:k≤(s-1)*(K+1)+1) (hj:K<j) (hjk:j≤2^k):
  2^(k-s)∣jU k s j:=by
 have hj0:0<j:=by omega
 have he:=RZ k s j (by omega) hj0 hjk
 have hv:=Xg hj0
 have hmono:(s-1)*(K+1)≤(s-1)*j:=Nat.mul_le_mul_left _ (by omega)
 have hprod:(s-1)*j=s*j-j:=by
  rw [Nat.sub_mul,one_mul]
 rw [hprod] at hmono
 have hsj:j≤ s*j:=Nat.le_mul_of_pos_left _ (by omega)
 apply (Nat.prime_two.pow_dvd_iff_le_factorization
  (TE k s j (by omega) hj0 hjk).ne').mpr
 omega
