   (∑' q:ℕ,(q:ℝ)^(1/2:ℝ)*‖coefficient (1:DirichletCharacter ℂ 1) (1:DirichletCharacter ℂ 1) m q‖)≤
    C*d5.c8 m*(m:ℝ)^ε:=by
